        <headline>Coastal Flood Statement issued September 26 at 2:30AM EDT until September 27 at 1:00PM EDT by NWS Miami FL</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Isolated minor coastal flooding expected.

* WHERE...Mainland Monroe and Far South Miami-Dade County.

* WHEN...Through Sunday afternoon.

* IMPACTS...Some water on low lying roads and property.
</description>
